        <p>
          Power users can type expressions quickly: digits and operators work as expected, Enter evaluates, Backspace deletes, and Escape clears. Type <strong>Shift+S</strong> for inverse sine, <strong>Shift+C</strong> for inverse cosine, and <strong>Shift+T</strong> for inverse tangent.
        </p>
      </section>

